:: invite her to your party {"position":"1000,1775","size":"100,100"}
"Hey Radiant." you say
<span class="radiant">"What is it $gamename"</span> she responds...
"Wanna join my party?"
<span class="radiant">"Yeah sure."</span> she says as you send her a party request. She accepts it.

<<link "Go back">> 
	<<if $partyMembers.includes("RadiantRose") or $partyMembers.length >= 3>>
	<<else>>
		<<run $partyMembers.push("RadiantRose")>>
		<<set $partyON to true>>
		<<dateadd '5m'>>
	<</if>>
    <<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
<</link>>


